{
  "sn44.7:0.1": "Linked Discourses 44.7 ",
  "sn44.7:0.2": "1. The Undeclared Points ",
  "sn44.7:0.3": "With Moggallāna ",
  "sn44.7:1.1": "Then the wanderer Vacchagotta went up to Venerable Mahāmoggallāna, and exchanged greetings with him. ",
  "sn44.7:1.2": "When the greetings and polite conversation were over, he sat down to one side, and said to Mahāmoggallāna: ",
  "sn44.7:2.1": "“Worthy Moggallāna, is this right: ‘the cosmos is eternal’?” ",
  "sn44.7:2.2": "“Vaccha, this has not been declared by the Buddha.” ",
  "sn44.7:2.3": "",
  "sn44.7:2.4": "“Then is this right: ‘the cosmos is not eternal’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.5": "",
  "sn44.7:2.6": "",
  "sn44.7:2.7": "‘the cosmos is finite’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.8": "",
  "sn44.7:2.9": "",
  "sn44.7:2.10": "‘the cosmos is infinite’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.11": "",
  "sn44.7:2.12": "",
  "sn44.7:2.13": "‘the soul and the body are one and the same’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.14": "",
  "sn44.7:2.15": "",
  "sn44.7:2.16": "‘the soul is one thing, the body another’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.17": "",
  "sn44.7:2.18": "",
  "sn44.7:2.19": "‘a realized one still exists after death’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.20": "",
  "sn44.7:2.21": "",
  "sn44.7:2.22": "‘a realized one no longer exists after death’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.23": "",
  "sn44.7:2.24": "",
  "sn44.7:2.25": "‘a realized one both still exists and no longer exists after death’ … ",
  "sn44.7:2.26": "",
  "sn44.7:2.27": "",
  "sn44.7:2.28": "‘a realized one neither still exists nor no lon